# .aiignore: paths that are read-only for agents. Gitignore syntax.
#
# The ov PreToolUse guard denies Edit, Write, MultiEdit and NotebookEdit on
# every path listed here. Read is never blocked: listed paths are read-only,
# not hidden.
#
# Edits made through Bash (sed -i, shell redirects, ...) are not intercepted
# by the guard. The ov-aiignore CI check is the backstop: it fails a PR when
# an agent commit touches a path listed in the base branch's .aiignore.
#
# Only a human edits this file. Commit changes to it as a human commit.

# ov enforcement files
.aiignore
.claude/settings.json
.github/workflows/ov-*.yml
.github/ov-ruleset-main.json
.specify/extensions/ov/**

# the human-written SRS (agents never author it)
docs/srs/SRS.md

